u-&gt;g: requestBudget(monthly or weekly)
g-&gt;c: generateBudget(period)
c-&gt;f: getFinancialData(userId)
f-&gt;db: load income, expenses, categories, goals
db--&gt;f: records
f--&gt;c: FinancialData
c-&gt;ai: analyzeFinances(data)
ai-&gt;ai: calculateBaseline(data)
ai-&gt;px: generateResponse(request)
px-&gt;px: checkAccess() and rate limit
px-&gt;ad: generateResponse(request)
ad-&gt;api: chatCompletion(payload)
api--&gt;ad: raw response
ad-&gt;ad: adaptResponse(raw)
ad--&gt;px: AIResponse
px--&gt;ai: AIResponse
ai--&gt;c: Recommendation
c-&gt;b: createBudget(recommendation)
c-&gt;db: saveBudget(budget)
c--&gt;g: display budget
g--&gt;u: suggested budget and category amounts
</panel_attributes><additional_attributes/></element>
<element><id>UMLNote</id><coordinates><x>20</x><y>767</y><w>1710</w><h>94</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>Alternative flows
- Not enough financial data or no recorded expenses: user is asked for more information and may retry later.
- AI unavailable or rate limit hit: user is told to try again later.
- Database retrieval fails: user is told the financial data could not be retrieved.</panel_attributes><additional_attributes/></element>
